		"description": "<p>With fiery heat, you pursue a fleeing foe. If an enemy moves out of a square you threaten and ends their movement within 20ft of you, you may expend your reaction to race after your target and make a single melee attack against them. This movement does not provoke attacks of opportunity, and your weapon deals fire damage until the end of your next turn.</p>",
